"Brox knows some of Davrar's hidden truth and of the Questors' rules."
"He fears the obelisks of bone."
"Later, Brox saves Itonia from an undead blight; the Seers tell him to fight Badud to the death."
"Later, Brox goads the Heirs into the dungeon of Fireface Pass."
"Later, Brox imposes a mental skill on Stella, who distrusts him ever after."
"Later, he duels Badud in a pass to shield Nathan, and dies to [Quenfi's Hatred], wounding Badud."
"His counter keeps his memory through [Reverse Time]; his black sword passes to Aarl."
"He respawns and is next found hunting in Elothia."
"Years later, he votes to help the Heirs and teaches Aarl swordsmanship and Insights."
"With Ushia and Sarya he hunts down the last Questor contesting Esebus."
"At the Ostren war he avoids Vesh; he says Sereth was the nightmare god to slay."
"At the Conclave he serves the Accord as a ringer, and Lyra Alys beats him."
"Nine years after, the Heirs displace Brox from Gemore, and some Questor allies cool."
